sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor M as Store Manager
  participant API as API (NestJS)
  participant Ord as Order Service
  participant Inv as Inventory Service
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor W as Warehouse Worker
  actor D as Delivery Agent

  M->>API: Accept order #SB-1042
  API->>Inv: Reserve items (FEFO)
  loop Each order item
    Inv->>DB: SELECT batches ORDER BY expiry_date ASC (available>0)
    Inv->>DB: INSERT stock_reservation (batch, location, qty, RESERVED)
    Inv->>DB: INSERT stock_movement (type=RESERVE)
  end
  Note over Inv,DB: Stock is reserved, NOT yet deducted<br/>(prevents double-selling)
  Inv->>DB: Generate pick_list + pick_list_items (batch + shelf)
  Inv-->>API: Reservation done + pick list ready
  API-->>M: Order CONFIRMED, picking assigned
  W->>API: Open pick list
  API-->>W: Item + qty + warehouse + shelf + batch
  W->>API: Mark items picked
  API->>Inv: Confirm pick
  W->>D: Hand over parcel
  D->>API: Mark OUT_FOR_DELIVERY
  API->>Inv: Convert reservation -> deduction
  Inv->>DB: UPDATE batch_stock (-qty), stock_movement (type=SALE)
  D->>API: Mark DELIVERED (cash collected)
  API->>DB: order=DELIVERED, payment=PAID
